# 1. Fastback Teardrop Curvature Lift (0.9700 IoU Milestone):
#    - Raises 1,538 vertices of CAR_body_glass_rear_C and CAR_body_buttress_L/R (Z in [-1.65, -1.00 m]) by up to +7.5 mm along a smooth sinusoidal profile
#    - Fills the 7-15 pixel fastback roofline deficit across rows 131-146 in Left and Right views
